---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/paths';

const lastUpdated = "November 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Portal:Current focus"
  description="What Ali Hasan is currently building, studying, and thinking about right now."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="pb-2 border-b border-[var(--border-color)]">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[var(--text-primary)] font-normal">
        Portal: Current Status
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-serif italic text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-1">
        From Ali's Wiki, tracking active academic courses, ongoing builds, and commercial directives.
      </p>
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] pt-1">
        Active revision: {lastUpdated}
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose-custom space-y-6 text-[var(--text-primary)] font-serif text-[15px]">
      <h2>1. Academic Directive (NED University)</h2>
      <p>
        Currently enrolled in the third semester of Computer Science &amp; Information Technology (BCIT) at NED University. Primary academic workload includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>CS-214 (Data Structures &amp; Algorithms)</strong>: Active development on our 3D spatial algorithm visualizer complex course project.</li>
        <li><strong>CT-260 (Object-Oriented Programming)</strong>: C++ OOP concepts, memory architectures, and exam simulations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Active Engineering Builds</h2>
      <p>
        Software prototypes under active iteration:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>3D Memory &amp; Algorithm Studio</strong>: Refactoring the viewport geometry and implementing the Google Stitch visual overhaul.</li>
        <li><strong>Small Software Cloud</strong>: Post-hackathon architectural adjustments to iframe sandbox permissions and local key-value state persistence.</li>
        <li><strong>Verified Call</strong>: Evaluating WebAuthn hardware-signed attestation models against real-time voice synthesis fraud vectors.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Commercial Ventures</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Notebloom</strong>: Inventory restocks and balance sheets following retail operations at the Habitt stall.</li>
        <li><strong>hkh.agency</strong>: Client consultations and web infrastructure development.</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- ALI opinion comment hook -->
      <!-- ALI: update this section whenever your main focus or reading list changes -->
    </div>

    <!-- Wikipedia Portal Footer Box -->
    <div class="mt-8 p-3 border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
      <div><strong>Status:</strong> Active Dispatch</div>
      <div><strong>Maintenance Policy:</strong> This portal is updated as priorities change.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
